sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CS as Content Specialist
  actor CO as Compliance Officer
  participant S as EventSafe System
  participant DB as Content and Version Repository
  participant A as Audit Log

  CS->>S: Create or edit checklist sections and items
  S->>S: Validate required fields, scoring weights, and schema

  alt Validation failed
    S-->>CS: Return error list and keep draft
  else Validation passed
    S->>DB: Save draft or revision
    S->>A: Write content revision event
    CS->>S: Submit for publication approval
    S->>CO: Notify compliance officer to review
    CO->>S: Review content and approve or reject

    alt Rejected
      S->>DB: Update status to rejected
      S->>A: Write rejection event
      S-->>CS: Notify revision and retain rejection reason
    else Approved
      S->>DB: Update status to approved
      S->>A: Write approval event
      CS->>S: Publish and bind to municipal jurisdiction
      S->>DB: Mark version effective for the jurisdiction
      S->>A: Write publication event
      S-->>CS: Return publication result and version number
    end
  end
